      "title": "Lighting and atmosphere",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Mid-morning, calm weather, warm and enclosed tropical maritime atmosphere. Warm tungsten lantern as the single key practical from frame-left, soft Rembrandt pooling, deep shadow falloff into the corners, thin hard daylight slivers leaking through plank gaps. Color palette of aged oak brown, tarred black, oxidized brass amber, sun-bleached parchment cream, shadowed sea-grey. Drifting dust motes in the lantern beam, faint smoke haze. Mood: enclosed, hushed, conspiratorial, weathered, intimate."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "Mid-morning, calm weather, warm and enclosed tropical maritime atmosphere. Warm tungsten lantern as the single key practical from frame-left, soft Rembrandt pooling, deep shadow falloff into the corners, thin hard daylight slivers leaking through plank gaps. Color palette of aged oak brown, tarred black, oxidized brass amber, sun-bleached parchment cream, shadowed sea-grey. Drifting dust motes in the lantern beam, faint smoke haze. Mood: enclosed, hushed, conspiratorial, weathered, intimate."
